5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We cannot promise schedules if the crews are already exhausted. I need to see the roster books.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Complaints say it is crowded, but I suspect the real delay is waiting. I will check the journey audits.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Headline budgets hide the long-term debt. I need to see the capital ledger balances.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,We repeat the same mistakes. I will read the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,Ground conditions and approvals kill projects. I will look at the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, if the ledger is tight, we cannot afford new staffing costs.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, did the old programme actually finish on time? I doubt it.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, exactly. The money is gone before the first bolt is turned.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Takumi, history is a teacher. I am checking what actually closed.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, the ledger is one thing, but the ground is another.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will also check the crew establishment and maintenance contract.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I will also look at the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will also review the ticketing contractor fees and paving rates.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will also examine the two pilots from eight years ago.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will also check the joint operators' committee minutes.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
