35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The late-turn pool is empty. Overtime covers everything. We have no slack.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"Audits show minutes are lost waiting for connections, not paying. The machines are fine.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The capital ledger is ring-fenced. The operating subsidy is trimmed. We are broke.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Servas,,The old accessibility programme finished four lifts on time. The lane priorities failed.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,Bidders price heavy contingency for pre-war shells. Three jobs stopped for weeks.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, if the subsidy is trimmed, we cannot fund new night shifts.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, so the lane work was a waste? That explains the mid-city delays.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, yes. The ticketing fees alone exceed our paving budget.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Takumi, the pilots from eight years ago worked. The ferry trial had no faults.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, the committee minutes show the ferry and rail never agreed on data terms.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"The maintenance contract has spare capacity for lifts, but the roadway crews are short.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"Timed runs are a third longer, but platform crowds clear at the old rate.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,Paving rates climbed again. Any roadworks will be expensive.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Servas,,The late-evening pilot met its cost-recovery target. That is a good sign.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"The roadway consents are delegated to us, but the data terms are stuck.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
