60,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Candidate A needs night staff. My rosters show we have none left.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Takumi,,Candidate B fixes the mid-city delay. The audits say that is where the time goes.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,Candidate D costs money we do not have. The ledger is empty.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Servas,,Candidate C fits the pattern. The old lift rebuilds finished on time.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,Candidate C has pre-war shells. The contingency pricing is a nightmare.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Jonathan, the maintenance contract has spare lift crews. That helps Candidate C.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Benjamin, Candidate B uses existing lanes. No new paving needed if we are careful.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Takumi, the ticketing fees are high, but Candidate D is a one-time fix.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@Asuka, the late-evening pilot worked. But the staffing is the killer.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Servas, the data terms for Candidate D are unresolved. The committee is stuck.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I cannot support A. The crews are exhausted. C is safer for maintenance.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Takumi,,"I support B. It addresses the actual delay. The lane work failed before, though.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I am wary of D. The fees are high, but the ledger is tight.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Servas,,I lean toward C. The history is good. The lifts worked last time.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I am worried about C. The ground is risky. B is delegated, though.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
